[TITLE]
S3 - No cleaning (k=0.1) | No vacuuming: all 7 sumps are 75% full of sediment (0.5 ft of storage left).
Continuous TSS simulation, HVN hourly rain Jan-2025 to Jun-2026. Based on user baseline WestHaven_JonesHill.inp

